{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## Tool Use\n\nUse the provided tool `extracted_data` to extract correct and accurate structured data from the input.\n\nTool purpose: Function call based on user instructions.\n\nCall the tool with the best supported arguments for the requested extraction."},{"role":"user","content":"You're an organizer responsible for only giving the skeleton (not the full content) for answering the question.\nProvide the skeleton in a list of points (numbered 1., 2., 3., etc.) to answer the question.\nInstead of writing a full sentence, each skeleton point should be very short with only 3-5 words.\nGenerally, the skeleton should have 3-10 points.\n\nNow, please provide the skeleton for the following question.\n\n<question>\nCompose an engaging travel blog post about a recent trip to Hawaii, highlighting cultural experiences and must-see attractions.\n<\/question>\n\nSkeleton:"}],"max_completion_tokens":1024,"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data","description":"Function call based on user instructions.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"points":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","description":"Correctly extract items of type: Point","properties":{"index":{"type":"integer"},"description":{"type":"string"}},"required":["index","description"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["points"],"additionalProperties":false}}}],"tool_choice":{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data"}},"reasoning_effort":"none"}